          SEG

          MOVE W I 100, R0
          MOVE W I 7, R1
          DIV W R0, R1, R2

          MOVE W I -100, R3
          MOVE W I 7, R4
          DIV W R3, R4, R5

          MOVE W I 100, R6
          MOVE W I -7, R7
          DIV W R6, R7, R8

          MOVE W I -100, R9
          MOVE W I -7, R10
          DIV W R9, R10, R11

          MOVE W I 12345, R0
          MOVE W I 67, R1
          MULT W R0, R1, R2

          MOVE W I -5, R3
          MOVE W I 3, R4
          MULT W R3, R4, R5

          MOVE W I H'7FFFFFFF', R6
          MOVE W I 2, R7
          MULT W R6, R7, R8

          HALT
          END
